{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b1f47bd9-2c35-8698-b57d-497ef89d9a4f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-08T14:46:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I know City Hall is closed today, it's Sunday, but my friend said this number is for the snow. Is it the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is the right one. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow, it knocked over my mailbox. It is lying on the ground, the post and everything. And it is so cold now, this cold snap, and we only got a little dusting of snow. A dusting! And still they hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's aggravating. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "402 Kingston Avenue. Historic Hill. I am the landlord, the tenants called me about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 402 Kingston Avenue, mailbox knocked down by a plow. Did it happen today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This morning, early. Maybe the tenants heard it, I don't know. Sorry, I was practicing a card trick for my nephew when they called, so I am a little distracted, but I am not happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll put it in as a plow damage report so someone looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And can you send sand also? The sidewalk and the driveway entrance are like ice with this cold. Somebody will slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note a request for sand at that address too. I can't tell you exactly when it'll get there, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not exactly when? What does that mean, you cannot say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I mean I don't understand the phrase."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It just means I can't give you a time. The crews go by their list. I'll pass it along as is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I understand. So the mailbox, and the sand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Mailbox at 402 Kingston Avenue, and sand. Is 401-555-0162 the best number if they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:46:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is my cell. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T14:46:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
